window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-d699de8288a37262"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"build-a-unit-plan-from-source-files\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">根据源文件制定单元教学计划</h1> <p>把课程标准、教学进度和以往课程整合成可实施的教学序列。</p> <p>使用课程标准、课程指导、既往教案、校历、评估指导和学习者需求，创建可编辑的单元计划，其中包括目标、课程顺序、来源链接和待审核标记。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>需要依据已批准课程资料规划单元的教师。</li> <li>需要对齐课程标准、教学进度、评估和校历的单元。</li> <li>需要明确呈现缺失或相互冲突的指导，而不是擅自猜测的规划工作。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>收集已批准的课程标准、教学进度指导、既往教案和评估材料。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>创建可编辑且链接到来源的单元计划。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>制定单元教学计划</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">使用此文件夹中的课程标准、教学进度指南、既往教案、评估指导、校历和学习者需求，制定一份长度为 [length]、适用于 [grade, subject, and topic] 的可编辑单元计划。\n\n请包括：\n- 学习目标\n- 课程安排顺序\n- 源文件链接\n- 形成性检查\n- 可能出现的误解\n- 待审核标记\n\n遇到缺失或相互冲突的指导时，请明确标出，不要猜测。请将结果标为 Draft（草稿），供教师审核。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"ground-the-unit-in-approved-sources\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">以已批准的来源为依据</h2> <p>收集课程标准、课程方案或教学进度指南、校历、既往教案、评估指导，以及与学习者相关的需求。确认哪些文件是当前有效资料，哪些只是示例。</p> <p>请 ChatGPT 将每项重要的规划决定对应到一份已批准的来源。</p> <p><a id=\"draft-the-sequence\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">起草教学顺序</h2> <p>使用起始提示词生成一份计划，包括：</p> <ol> <li>学习目标和课程标准。</li> <li>符合可用校历安排的课程顺序。</li> <li>所需材料和源文件链接。</li> <li>形成性检查以及与评估的衔接。</li> <li>可能的误解或先备知识缺口。</li> <li>需要教师审核的决定和缺失指导。</li> </ol> <p>草稿应说明每节课为何安排在该顺序中，而不只是列出活动。</p> <p><a id=\"review-instructional-judgment\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">审核教学判断</h2> <p>检查课程标准对齐情况、教学进度、评估负担、无障碍性和年龄适切性。确认 ChatGPT 没有编造学区要求或学习者信息。</p> <p>在同一对话中修改计划；在用它生成演示文稿或课堂材料之前，清楚标出已获批准的版本。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"build-a-unit-plan-from-source-files\">Build a unit plan from source files</h1> <p>Turn standards, pacing, and prior lessons into a teachable sequence.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT with standards, curriculum guidance, prior lesson files, a school calendar, assessment guidance, and learner needs to create an editable unit plan with goals, lesson sequence, source links, and review flags.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Teachers planning a unit from approved curriculum sources.</li> <li>Units that need standards, pacing, assessment, and calendar alignment.</li> <li>Planning where missing or conflicting guidance should remain visible.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>Gather approved standards, pacing guidance, prior lessons, and assessment materials.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Create an editable, source-linked unit plan.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Create a Unit Plan</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Using the standards, pacing guide, prior lesson files, assessment guidance, calendar, and learner needs in this folder, create an editable [length] unit plan for [grade, subject, and topic].\n\nInclude:\n- learning goals\n- lesson sequence\n- links to source files\n- formative checks\n- likely misconceptions\n- review flags\n\nFlag missing or conflicting guidance instead of guessing. Label the result Draft for educator review.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"ground-the-unit-in-approved-sources\">Ground the unit in approved sources</h2> <p>Collect the standards, curriculum or pacing guide, school calendar, prior lessons, assessment guidance, and relevant learner needs. Identify which documents are current and which are examples only.</p> <p>Ask ChatGPT to map every major planning decision to an approved source.</p> <h2 id=\"draft-the-sequence\">Draft the sequence</h2> <p>Use the starter prompt to create a plan with:</p> <ol> <li>Learning goals and standards.</li> <li>A lesson sequence that fits the available calendar.</li> <li>Required materials and source links.</li> <li>Formative checks and assessment connections.</li> <li>Likely misconceptions or prerequisite gaps.</li> <li>Decisions and missing guidance for teacher review.</li> </ol> <p>The draft should show why each lesson belongs in the sequence, not only list activities.</p> <h2 id=\"review-instructional-judgment\">Review instructional judgment</h2> <p>Check the standards alignment, pacing, assessment load, accessibility, and age appropriateness. Confirm that ChatGPT has not invented district requirements or learner information.</p> <p>Revise the plan in the same chat, then mark the approved version clearly before using it to generate decks or classroom materials.</p>"};
